OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome late
OL,6,Fsunshine for most, then a dry evening
OL,7,Fand overnight period with often clear
OL,8,Fskies. Staying cloudier across the
OL,9,FIsles of Scilly and Cornwall, but
OL,10,Felsewhere clear skies prevailing and
OL,11,Fturning quite chilly, especially in
OL,12,Fthe countryside further east.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FAny mist patches quickly
OL,15,Fclearing to leave prolonged sunny
OL,16,Fperiods for most. Perhaps staying
OL,17,Fcloudier in the west, chiefly Devon
OL,18,Fand Cornwall, but widely warm with
OL,19,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
