OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSome
OL,6,Fwarm sunshine for many on Tuesday and
OL,7,FWednesday but turning breezier and
OL,8,Ffresher later with the odd shower
OL,9,Fpossible. Dry with sunny spells on
OL,10,FThursday after a cold start.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
